---
name: autonomous_authorization_patterns
priority: 100
condition: ~
patterns:
  - fully autonomous
  - hands-off
  - hands off
  - don't ask me
  - don't ask us
  - do not ask me
  - do not ask us
  - without asking me
  - without asking us
  - unattended
  - keep going until done without checking
  - you decide everything
  - just do it all
  - no check-ins
  - work autonomously
  - work in the background
